(82, 2, 'Today’s Ayah 🌿\r\n‎فَإِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا\r\n\r\n“Indeed, with hardship comes ea\r\nse.”\r\n\r\nQur’an 94:5\r\n\r\nWhatever you’re going through today, remember that hardship does not last forever.\r\nWhat are you currently asking Allah to make easy for you? 🤲', NULL, 'public', 0, '2026-08-12 22:54:39', '2026-08-12 22:54:39'),
